 "head_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-head\" aria-label=\"Race header\">\n  <div class=\"enc-cd-head__top\">\n    <a class=\"enc-cd-back\" href=\"card.html\"\n       aria-label=\"Back to card\">\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&lsaquo;</span>\n      <span>Card</span>\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"enc-cd-racenav\" aria-label=\"Race navigation\">\n      \n        <a class=\"enc-cd-racenav__chev\" href=\"race-3.html\"\n           data-role=\"race-prev\"\n           aria-label=\"Previous race\">&lsaquo;</a>\n      \n      <span class=\"enc-cd-racenav__label\">\n        Race 4<span class=\"enc-cd-racenav__of\">/9</span>\n      </span>\n      \n        <a class=\"enc-cd-racenav__chev\" href=\"race-5.html\"\n           data-role=\"race-next\"\n           aria-label=\"Next race\">&rsaquo;</a>\n      \n    </nav>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"enc-cd-head__title\">British EBF Future Stayers&#x27; Novice Stakes (Sire And Dam Restricted Race) (Plus 10 Race) (GBB/GBBPlus Race)</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"enc-cd-head__meta\">\n    Bath &middot; \n    15:32\n     &middot; 1m\n     &middot; Good to Firm\n     &middot; Class 3\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"enc-cd-head__strip\">\n    \n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip enc-cd-chip--open\">2h 52m to off</span>\n    \n\n    \n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip enc-cd-chip--prize\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__label\">Prize</span>\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__value\">£11,880</span>\n      </span>\n    \n\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-chip enc-cd-chip--field\">\n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__label\">Field</span>\n      <span class=\"enc-cd-chip__value\">6</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n",
 "pick_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-pick\" aria-label=\"Your pick\">\n\n  \n    <form class=\"enc-cd-pick__form\" method=\"post\"\n          action=\"race-4.pick.json\"\n          data-role=\"pick-form\">\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrfmiddlewaretoken\" value=\"sandbox\">\n      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"horse_name\" value=\"\" data-role=\"horse-input\">\n\n      \n        <p class=\"enc-cd-pick__eyebrow\">Your pick</p>\n        <p class=\"enc-cd-pick__title enc-cd-pick__title--muted\"\n           data-role=\"empty-title\">Tap a horse below to pick.</p>\n      \n\n      <fieldset class=\"enc-cd-pick__stake\" data-role=\"stake\"\n                disabled\n                aria-label=\"Stake in credits\">\n        <legend class=\"enc-cd-pick__stake-label\">\n          Stake\n          <span class=\"enc-cd-pick__balance\">\n            Balance 1000\n          </span>\n        </legend>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-pick__chips\" role=\"radiogroup\">\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"1\"\n                     checked>\n              <span>1</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"2\"\n                     >\n              <span>2</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"3\"\n                     >\n              <span>3</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"4\"\n                     >\n              <span>4</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"5\"\n                     >\n              <span>5</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"6\"\n                     >\n              <span>6</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"7\"\n                     >\n              <span>7</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"8\"\n                     >\n              <span>8</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"9\"\n                     >\n              <span>9</span>\n            </label>\n          \n            <label class=\"enc-cd-pick__chip\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"stake_credits\" value=\"10\"\n                     >\n              <span>10</span>\n            </label>\n          \n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <div class=\"enc-cd-pick__row\">\n        <p class=\"enc-cd-pick__status\" data-role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n        <button type=\"submit\"\n                class=\"enc-cd-pick__submit\"\n                data-role=\"submit\"\n                disabled>\n          Confirm pick\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n  \n</section>\n",
 "letter_html": "<section class=\"enc-cd-letter enc-cd-letter--high\"\n         aria-label=\"LLaMa's read on this race\">\n  <header class=\"enc-cd-letter__head\">\n    <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__mono\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🦙</span>\n    <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__title-block\">\n      <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__eyebrow\">LLaMa&rsquo;s read</p>\n      <h2 class=\"enc-cd-letter__title\">Predicted 1&mdash;2&mdash;3&mdash;4</h2>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <ol class=\"enc-cd-letter__slots\">\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-1\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥇\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            1st\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">2/7</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Divide And Conquer</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 160 is the highest in the field by a clear margin, Beckett&#x27;s yard is running at 20% in the past 14 days, and the steaming market move to 2/7 confirms the trade agrees.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-2\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥈\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            2nd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">11/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Political Resident</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 145 is the second highest in the field and Balding&#x27;s debutants often run into a place; the drift is a concern but the rating earns this slot.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-3\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          🥉\n          \n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            3rd\n            \n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">9/2</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Al Qayed</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">Two runs, two thirds — consistent if unspectacular; the class drop from previous starts and Haggas&#x27;s involvement keep him honest for the minor places.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n      <li class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot enc-cd-letter__slot--pos-4\">\n        <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__medal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          4\n        </span>\n        <div class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-body\">\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-eyebrow\">\n            Predicted\n            4th\n            \n              &middot; <span class=\"enc-cd-letter__price\">22/1</span>\n            \n          </p>\n          <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__horse\">Next Best</p>\n          \n            <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__slot-note\">SR 132 is workmanlike and Eve Johnson Houghton&#x27;s yard is cold at 3%, but debut horses can outrun their odds and 22/1 reflects a live each-way outsider in a thin field.</p>\n          \n        </div>\n      </li>\n    \n  </ol>\n\n  \n    <p class=\"enc-cd-letter__verdict\">Mr Fox has Divide And Conquer in his notebook at 2/5 and on this occasion the data gives him no argument to answer. The SR of 160, Beckett&#x27;s 20% yard form, Rossa Ryan in the saddle, and a market that has steamed rather than drifted — every signal points the same direction. The only reservation is the price: 2/7 is short, and taking that on a horse with just one run under its belt on an unknown trip requires conviction. I have that conviction. The gap between Divide And Conquer and anything else in this field is not marginal — it is structural. This is a win bet, one unit, at 2/7, taken with eyes open to the fact that any novelty (trip, ground, track) could create an opening for Political Resident. I don&#x27;t expect it to matter.</p>\n  \n\n  \n    <a class=\"enc-cd-letter__more\" href=\"https://www.saturday-racing.com/letters/bath-2026-09-29/1532/\">\n      Read the full letter &rarr;\n    </a>\n  \n</section>\n",
